It is Thursday.
I am a little tired after work.
But I take the U-Bahn to the gym.
It is exactly half past five.
I am here every Thursday at half past five.
That is my routine in February.
The gym is full today.
Many people train in the evening.
I run first.
Then I do my training.
That is sometimes hard.
But I always train for an hour.
Now I am finished.
I am not tired anymore.
I have another appointment this evening.
At half past seven I am at the hairdresser.
I have plenty of time.
I am looking forward to the haircut.
